                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Well, here we are, the final episode of otrspod... The gameplay switches yet again from ep3's typical rpg game to something more akin to pokémon with an unique spin. This is the most serious episode in the quadrilogy but there are still plenty of funny moments, it's just that the serious moments are taken more seriously. The ending ties everything together so nicely and makes all the small moments of foreshadowing in previous episode hit you like a brick to the face when you go back to play the previous episodes... 10/10, I love doomed yaoi and whoever said that this series is just like Sam & Max 305 you're so right and I am in so much emotional pain over these two idiots... T^T",
